  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;RORY PATTERSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rory Patterson is a football player born in 1984 in Northern Ireland, known for his passion and talent in football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLERAINE F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coleraine F.C. is a football club based in Coleraine, County Londonderry, founded in 1927, known for producing talented players and competing at the highest levels of Northern Irish football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HJK HELSINKI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"HJK Helsinki is a football club based in Helsinki, Finland, known for its competitive spirit and strong team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORTHERN IRELAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Northern Ireland is a region in the United Kingdom known for its rich football culture and the love for the sport."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NIFL PREMIERSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NIFL Premiership is the top division of Northern Irish football, where Coleraine F.C. competes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARKKU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Markku is Rory Patterson's agent, known for his confidence in Rory's abilities and potential."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAMES MCLAUGHLIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"James McLaughlin is a teammate of Rory Patterson at Coleraine F.C., forming a deadly strike partnership with him."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TEEMU PUKKI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Teemu Pukki is a Finnish striker at HJK Helsinki, known for his friendly demeanor and encouragement towards Rory."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COACH KANERVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coach Kanerva is the coach of HJK Helsinki, known for his gruff but fair leadership style."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HELSINKI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Helsinki is the capital city of Finland, where HJK Helsinki is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNTY LONDONDERRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"County Londonderry is a county in Northern Ireland where Coleraine F.C. is based."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINNISH LEAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Finnish League is the top division of Finnish football where HJK Helsinki competes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Team refers to the Finnish national football team, which Rory Patterson aspires to join."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PITCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The pitch is the playing field where football matches take place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLING HILLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The rolling hills of Northern Ireland are the birthplace of Rory Patterson and the setting of his early football career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SNOW-DUSTED PAVEMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The snow-dusted pavement in Helsinki is where Rory Patterson first steps onto the ground after arriving at HJK Helsinki."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRAINING FACILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The training facility is where HJK Helsinki's players train and prepare for matches."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FROZEN LANDSCAPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The frozen landscape of Helsinki is the backdrop for Rory Patterson's arrival at HJK Helsinki."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOLDEN GLOW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The golden glow over the frozen landscape of Helsinki symbolizes the hope and optimism for Rory Patterson's future."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0422</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOOK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
