    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;RORY PATTERSON&quot;" target="&quot;COLERAINE F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rory Patterson signed a contract with Coleraine F.C. in 2012, becoming an integral part of the team and scoring 12 goals in his debut season."</data>
      <data key="d5">"contract, performance, inspiration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0422</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RORY PATTERSON&quot;" target="&quot;JAMES MCLAUGHLIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rory Patterson and James McLaughlin formed a deadly strike partnership at Coleraine F.C., terrorizing defenses across the league."</data>
      <data key="d5">"partnership, teamwork"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0422</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RORY PATTERSON&quot;" target="&quot;HJK HELSINKI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rory Patterson moved to HJK Helsinki, a Finnish football club, where he continues to thrive and entertain the idea of a national team call-up."</data>
